/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
   Cursors Delphi's Controls unit links from CONTROLS.RES (crDrag,
   crMultiDrag, crHSplit). The images are Microsoft WinFile's move and split
   cursors (MIT, vendor/reference/microsoft-winfile); compile with
   -i=vendor/reference/microsoft-winfile/src. */
DRAG      CURSOR smove.cur
MULTIDRAG CURSOR mmove.cur
HSPLIT    CURSOR split.cur
